        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga hees weechi sea Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghoah sugoocheanda aba jeeda Israeleeda sean ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak suh ea fugaaschi hees gil was weedangaaschi. Asariya orjeeda Sadoki ghoah ashoohoocheanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elihorefu ea Ahiya orjooga Shisha ghoah ng'oorshoodiga. Yehoshafati orjeeda Ahiludi ghoah siichea goodiiwi haleanjeeda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya orjeeda Yehoyada ghoah siida haw bea shirikara; Sadoki ea Abiyatari ghoah ashoohoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asariya orjeeda Natani ghoah siichea gamiineadaysa fuga hees; Sabundi orjeeda Natani ghoah ashoohoocheanda ak nea gwarooroochi sea sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahishari ghoah siida haw bea gheeda; ak Adoniramu orjeeda Abda ghoah siida miineadaysa fuga gadiyeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani gwandeawa fih damaniyeenya was fuga weeta aba jeeda Israeleeda sean, gakiisa hamita sugoocheanda ea fugeaba gheanyi; giliwas sih gaygagasa hamita aba sheeda mughuush aba jeemba gweayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheawunga nyaawa suh gil: Ben-huri bea ng'eanyiida heayeeniga Efraimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benadeka bea Makasi, Shalbimu, Bet-shemeshi ea Elon-bet-hanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ben-hesedi, bea Aruboti (aba headaanyi gaba Soko ea ng'eanyiida sean bea Heferi) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benabinadabu, bea Nafat-dori heeda sean (gwandeawa Nafat-dori hudeaba Sulemani ghoah gatmoadaanyi); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana orjeeda Ahiludi bea Daanaki, ea Megido, ea Bet-sheaneeda sean mida murdeeda Saretani hing'eadayda Yesneli, ea gidang'eada Bet-sheani ea gagul Abel-mehola ea ghwahita meatkweeda niirja bea Yokmeyamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ben-geberi, bea Ramot-gileyadi (mideawa gharang'weaka Yairi orjeeda Manase, mida Gileyadi, nea gwandeawa ng'eanyiida Argobu, mida Bashani, bea mujiinajeega hees was laadam mideawa ghamarjeeka ea gharinga hang'oonyi); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahinadabu orjeeda Ido mida Mahanaimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimasi, mida Naftali (nigeanda Basemati was hudeaba Sulemani ghoah gatmoadaanyi); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana orjeeda Hushayi mida Asheri ea Bealoti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati orjeeda Baruwa, mida ng'eanyiida Isakari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimeyi orjeeda Ela mida ng'eanyiida Benjamini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giberi orjeeda Uri, mida ng'eanyiida Gileyadi, ng'eanyiida Sihoni was sugoocheanda eemeeda Amori ea Ogu was sugoocheanda fuga Bashani. Ak ea mandana siisi miineadayda ng'eanyiida Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gheambalmeeda haw bea Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda ea Israeli ea saang'a ea gwadeena iseaskweanda ghuuta basooda; hean gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi nea gahoosan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani ghoahaaghwa ng'eanyoojiga sean ng'eada Furati ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Filisti ea ghwahita moonghooda ng'eanyiida Misri; hean gweatu gwaadi nea gagadiiyeesa Sulemani eawoojiga sean bea eaweagaaschi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani daghwardaanyi aba eaweecheanjagi mushoodaw diktam gil ea damanamughuush bea dearanga miyaasiin ea mushoodaw laadam bea booga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "heew damanamughuush riisheadi, ea duuh diktam siihaaghwa ea gisil bughala, sheashoonga ea mayeanyeeka ea darweediga ea ndoopkajeega ea diyeanga riisheadi bea dabiniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwandeawa uurda aba ng'eanyiida sean bea dirbeayda Furati gidang'eada Difsa ea gagul Gaasa, ak goombal eara sugoodiga mida dirbeayda Furati; ak gwasin hoyyoo aba meatkwajeega sean neaweesa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda ea Israeli goobiida jeeda miyeenooda, gidang'eada Dani ea ghwahita Beer-sheba, gilba sih goobiida guumda sabiiboadaanyi ea guumda shaboogheecheandaanyi, aba jeeda eawoojiga sean bea Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani gaba geali bughalaji haradam bea mutukwajeega faraasajeagaaschi, ea fih bughalaji damaniyeenya ding'da faraasajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fugiga heesiin gweadu hamita heeda measeeda sugoocheanda was Sulemani, gilinyoo ea sih gil ea sheanagi; ea mudugwanda gida shoadeawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara ngaano ea mbarariida geataw faraasajeega ea diyeanga ng'weani ak geeyeadu heeda doobiiwsa gilinyoo ea siida gil ea gadiyeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoadaw ASEETA Sulemani weaghuumeeda ea fughareeda haw manda gisigala, deena iseaskweanda ghuuta basooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi weaghuumeeda Sulemani gaburdeawa weaghuumeeda fuga sean bea gayeew, ea weaghuumeeda sean bea fuga ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba niny ea weaghoot ea ghang'al buuneesean, ak ea weaghoot ea ghang'al Etani bea eemeeda Esarahi, ea Hemani, ea Galkoli, ea Darda, orjooga Maholi; ak ghwahita alooheadaanyi ng'eanyoojiga sean neaweesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean gwaruku ghwasiildean bughalaji samwagu; nea duumjeengaaschi ea bughala ea muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabaloola geediga, ghang'eada gubooyeanda mida Lebanoni ea geeta siguura hisoopo rinna murdeeda ghamarda; ea gabaloola eara diyeanga ea dariidaka ea ichipkeega, ea ghweayeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghapkaana headiga jeeda buuneesean gooleeysiit weaghuumeeda Sulemani, ak gwaleabu heeda sugoodiga sean mida jeeda ng'eanyiida was gea niyiiy weaghuumeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.34",
